  "description" : "* Based on an e-sports school life yuri manga by http://anidb.net/cr62773 [Ejima Eri].\nhttp://anidb.net/ch146906 [Mitsuki Aya], who played fighting games competitively as a child, transferred into Kuromi Girls Academy in order to become a proper lady. Upon meeting http://anidb.net/ch146905 [Yorue Mio], known throughout school as the White Lily, Aya is blown away by her grace and elegance. To her surprise, however, she later finds Mio playing a fighting game online and coarsely trash-talking her opponents after school. And if that wasn`t perplexing enough, this unladylike version of Mio challenges her to a duel.\nSource: MangaDex (modified)\nNote: The first two episodes received an early screening at a special event on 4 July 2026 at Red Bull Gaming Sphere in Tokyo which was additionally streamed on Kadokawa`s YouTube channel. The regular TV broadcast started on 7 July 2026.",
